OL,3,ATank barrel production returns to UK
OL,4,Aafter 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe production of gun barrels to be
OL,7,Fused on tanks has returned to the UK
OL,8,Ffor the first time in 20 years with the
OL,9,Fopening of a new manufacturing
OL,10,Ffacility.
OL,12,FThe UK Gun Hall in Telford, run by
OL,13,FGerman defence firm Rheinmetall, has
OL,14,Fsupported 100 jobs and will make
OL,15,Fbarrels and breeches for large calibre
OL,16,Fweapons.
OL,18,FDefence secretary, Wes Streeting,
OL,19,Fattended the opening ceremony on
OL,20,FThursday and said Britain was "back in
OL,21,Fthe business of making weapons" for its
OL,22,Farmed forces.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
