OL,3,ATank barrel production returns to UK
OL,4,Aafter 20 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"From an empty site to full production
OL,7,Fin eight months, this is rapid
OL,8,Freindustrialisation in action," he
OL,9,Fsaid.
